<title>UK: UBS leads 100 million Swiss franc domestic bond.</title>
<headline>UBS leads 100 million Swiss franc domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EMISSIONSZENTRALE SCHWEIZER RAIFFEISENBANKEN SERIE 22</p>
<p>  AMT    100 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.250     MATURITY    05.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.00    PAY DATE    05.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   17.JAN.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
